  "description": "A security vulnerability has been detected in Toggl O\u00dc Toggl Track Extension up to 4.11.21. This affects an unknown function of the component postMessage Handler. The manipulation leads to origin validation error. It is possible to initiate the attack remotely. The exploit has been disclosed publicly and may be used. Upgrading to version 4.11.22 mitigates this issue. Upgrading the affected component is advised. The vendor confirms, that \"[i]t was fixed in 4.11.21 on Chrome and 4.11.22 on Firefox.\"",
